      <h2 id="insights-operator-manual-upload_remote-health-reporting-from-restricted-network" class="group scroll-mt-20">Uploading an Insights Operator archive<a href="#insights-operator-manual-upload_remote-health-reporting-from-restricted-network" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
